<title>UK: Deutsche Bank adds 1.0 trln lire to bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank adds 1.0 trln lire to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 5.0 trillion lire from 4.0 trillion lire, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The increase was a block trade.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLAND BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    15.OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  UNDISC    PAY DATE    10.DEC.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
